 "description": "Use this only when the signed-in owner explicitly asks to create or edit their MyLegend agent. Save only the fields they choose to share from this conversation, never the whole chat. Read the current revision first (0 if no draft). Saves a PRIVATE draft, never publishes. Show the proposed text for review and link to MyLegend for owner approval. Do not invent credentials or infer sensitive details.",
